{
  "comment": [
    "Architecture ratchet (UI review report P2-2). watchedRoots are scanned",
    "for *.kt; new files must stay under newFileMaxLines. Files already over",
    "the cap when the policy landed are listed in baseline with their ceiling:",
    "they may shrink but never grow. Tighten after a legitimate extraction:",
    "python3 scripts/ci/check_architecture_policy.py --update-baseline",
    "(only ever lowers entries or removes graduated/stale ones).",
    "forbiddenPatterns are literal substrings that must not appear in any",
    "watched *.kt file (one-way ratchet, no baseline).",
    "forbiddenImports pair a fromPath regex (matched against the watched",
    "file's POSIX path) with a ban substring that must not occur in a real",
    "`import` statement (line-start keyword; comments and string literals are",
    "masked out first, so prompts containing the word `import` are ignored).",
    "forbiddenImportsBaseline freezes existing debt per file as a count",
    "ceiling: --update-baseline only lowers entries or drops clean ones and",
    "can never register NEW debt — fix the imports instead. Baselined here at",
    "registration: the composition-root entry points MainActivity.kt/",
    "MinisApp.kt (wire the Compose UI by design) plus the known layering debt",
    "in webapp/, config/ConfigBuiltins.kt, i18n/LocaleWrap.kt,",
    "deeplink/DeepLinkHandler.kt and data/db/ProviderThinkingRuleMapper.kt,",
    "all scheduled for extraction in later batches.",
    "FQN UPGRADE (review v3 item 9): forbiddenImports bans are matched against the",
    "FULL code text (comments/strings masked) after stripping the `import ` prefix,",
    "so bare fully-qualified references like com.openminis.app.ui.X(...) with no",
    "import are caught too. The scan exposed pre-existing FQN debt the old",
    "import-only check could not see; per the v3 fix batch it is REGISTERED here",
    "by hand (not migrated): sandbox/PRootKernel.kt (MirrorSpeedTestViewModel calls,",
    ":89-90), browser/BrowserUseManager.kt (BrowserExternalSchemeHandler, :415/:419),",
    "config/ConfigBuiltins.kt (ui.settings KEY_* FQNs), debug/ProviderDebugMethods.kt",
    "(ui.components QuickTest*), speech/correction/VoiceCorrection.kt and",
    "tools/GroupChat.kt (ui.chat types in signatures), ui/ files tripping the",
    "ui->data.db rule via bare data.db FQNs (ChatScreen, ChatViewModel*,",
    "SessionList*, ScheduledTasksViewModel) and composition roots MainActivity/",
    "MinisApp (UI wiring by design). Counts above are the current ceiling; code",
    "migration is a later batch — the ceiling never rises."
  ],
  "newFileMaxLines": 800,
  "forbiddenPatterns": [
    {
      "pattern": ".collectAsState(",
      "reason": "lifecycle-unaware collection — use collectAsStateWithLifecycle() from androidx.lifecycle.compose"
    },
    {
      "pattern": "import androidx.compose.runtime.collectAsState",
      "reason": "lifecycle-unaware collection — import collectAsStateWithLifecycle from androidx.lifecycle.compose"
    }
  ],
  "forbiddenImports": [
    {
      "fromPath": "com/openminis/app/data/db/",
      "ban": "import com.openminis.app.provider.",
      "reason": "db layer must not reach into the provider layer — map at the boundary"
    },
    {
      "fromPath": "com/openminis/app/(data|sandbox|provider|browser)/",
      "ban": "import com.openminis.app.ui.",
      "reason": "data/sandbox/provider/browser are headless layers — UI types stay in ui/"
    },
    {
      "fromPath": "^(?!.*com/openminis/app/(ui|automation/ui|quick|cards)/)",
      "ban": "import com.openminis.app.ui.",
      "reason": "com.openminis.app.ui is the UI layer — non-UI sources (deeplink, config, i18n, webapp, agent, tools, ...) must not import it. automation/ui/, quick/ and cards/ are feature-owned UI subpackages (Compose screens/activities/renderers next to their engine); they import ui components by design, like ui/ itself."
    },
    {
      "fromPath": "com/openminis/app/ui/",
      "ban": "import com.openminis.app.data.db.",
      "reason": "ui must not touch Room entities directly; go through repository/DTO (batch-6 item 21, frozen debt: baseline only shrinks)"
    }
  ],
